 "message": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>KPI Action Overdue Notification - {{ doc.name }}</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 720px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n        h2 {\n            color: #dc3545;\n            font-size: 20px;\n        }\n        p {\n            font-size: 14px;\n            color: #555;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n        table th {\n            background: #dc3545;\n            color: #fff;\n            padding: 10px;\n            text-align: left;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n        table td {\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\n            padding: 10px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n        .alert {\n            background: #f8d7da;\n            border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;\n            padding: 12px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #721c24;\n        }\n        .cta {\n            background: #fff3cd;\n            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;\n            padding: 12px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #664d03;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #888;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n    <p>Dear Stakeholder,</p>\n\n    <p>\n        This is to inform you that the following KPI Action has been flagged as <strong>OVERDUE</strong>.\n        This notification is being shared with both the responsible Action Owner and relevant oversight stakeholders for visibility and governance purposes.\n    </p>\n    \n    <div class=\"alert\">\n        <strong>Overdue Status Triggered:</strong> The due date has passed and the action remains incomplete as of today.\n    </div>\n    \n    <p>\n        <strong>KPI Action ID:</strong> {{ doc.name }}<br>\n        <strong>Action Description:</strong> {{ doc.action_description }}<br>\n        <strong>Function:</strong> {{ doc.function }}<br>\n        <strong>Priority:</strong> {{ doc.priority }}<br>\n        <strong>Due Date:</strong> {{ doc.due_date }}<br>\n        <strong>Status:</strong> {{ doc.status }}\n    </p>\n    \n    {% if doc.supporting_team %}\n    <p><strong>Supporting Team:</strong></p>\n    \n    <ul>\n        {% for member in doc.supporting_team %}\n            <li>{{ member.supporting_member or member }}</li>\n        {% endfor %}\n    </ul>\n    {% endif %}\n    \n    <div class=\"cta\">\n        <strong>Expected Action</strong><br>\n        The responsible Action Owner is expected to review this item and take the necessary corrective steps to complete the task.\n        Where blockers exist, escalation to the relevant Function Head or governance lead is recommended without delay.\n    </div>\n    \n    <p>\n        For full details and tracking, you may access the KPI Action record below:\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        <a href=\"{{ frappe.utils.get_url() }}/app/kpi-action/{{ doc.name }}\">\n            Open KPI Action\n        </a>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        Regards,<br>\n        ERP System - KPI Tracker\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        This is an automated notification. Please do not reply.\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
